==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 95% HP:
**3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

